// Type scale, elevation and layout grid styles
// Shows: text styles on a modular scale, effect styles for elevation, a paint style with a gradient, a column layout grid, a specimen sheet that documents them
// Foundations: semantic colour variables, then text and effect styles. Interface layers bind to these, never to raw hex; literal colours are for artwork and for data series beyond the brand.
